    </questionnote>
    <questiondescription format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>This question is based on the examples log 6 + log 3 − log 9 and 2 log 5 + log 4 in the section Solving Logarithmic Equations I of the CBC Grade 11 Mathematics textbook (INNODEMS). Rebuilt: the only test expected an empty result, and log_b(b^p) + log_b(b^q) needed no laws at all. It now needs the product, quotient and power laws, as in the textbook.</p>
<p id="concept">Product, quotient and power laws</p>]]></text>
    </questiondescription>
